The following components in Scriptorium are adapted from MISAKA-Agent:

  - scriptorium/documents/store.py        — content-addressed document store
  - scriptorium/documents/outline.py      — hierarchical outline detection
  - scriptorium/documents/quote_verify.py — quote normalization and verification
  - scriptorium/documents/page_nav.py     — page-based navigation
  - scriptorium/documents/extractors/     — multi-format text extractors
    (text, pdf, html, epub, office)

These files were ported from MISAKA-Agent's misaka/core/documents/ module
and modified for use in Scriptorium's evidence-traced discourse analysis
pipeline. Modifications include adaptation to the DocumentStore SQLite schema,
integration with the evidence span system, and removal of features not needed
by Scriptorium (OCR routing, VLM integration, PageIndex Flash).

The adversarial multi-perspective dialectical architecture was also inspired
by MISAKA-Agent's multi-agent orchestration design.

